</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T5.3.27" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T5.3.27.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A6.T5.3.27.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:426.8pt;">
<span id="A6.T5.3.27.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.T5.3.27.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">{# Current QA Annotations or Initial Annotations}</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T5.3.28" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T5.3.28.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A6.T5.3.28.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:426.8pt;">
<span id="A6.T5.3.28.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.T5.3.28.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">You invite an expert whose description is: {# Profile}</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T5.3.29" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T5.3.29.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A6.T5.3.29.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:426.8pt;">
