<span id="A6.T6.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.T6.3.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Prompts for Model-based Evaluation (Strict Acc).</span></span>
</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A6.T6.3.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T6.3.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A6.T6.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:426.8pt;">
<span id="A6.T6.3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.T6.3.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">You are an advertising expert specializing in evaluating whether a respondent’s answer after watching a video matches the golden answer. We will provide the video’s Meta-Information, Question, Golden Answer, and the Response to be judged below.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T6.3.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T6.3.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
