<span id="A6.T6.3.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.T6.3.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">###The meta-information includes the advertisement video’s theme, creative points, and a brief content description, which can be regarded as ground-truth information, as follows::
{#meta_info}</span></span>
<span id="A6.T6.3.3.1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.T6.3.3.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">###Question:
{#question}</span></span>
<span id="A6.T6.3.3.1.1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.T6.3.3.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">###Golden Answer:
{#golden_answer}</span></span>
<span id="A6.T6.3.3.1.1.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.T6.3.3.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">###Rule:</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T6.3.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T6.3.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A6.T6.3.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:426.8pt;">
<span id="A6.T6.3.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.T6.3.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">1. If the response to be judged contains ALL key information of the golden answer or expresses the same meaning using other sentences or synonyms, it is considered a match with the golden answer, and the output is 1.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T6.3.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T6.3.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
